{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Deltabrief 是一款每日科技簡報應用，把人工智能、企業人工智能、金融科技與最值得留意的新科技四大範疇，濃縮成每期只談重點的編輯精選內容，適合想快速掌握行業變化、又不願在資訊流中逐條篩選的上班族與投資者。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-13.webp\">\n<h2>四大科技範疇每日精編</h2>\n<p>每期涵蓋企業人工智能部署、金融科技與支付、模型與研究、政策法規及投資動向，並設美國、中國與新加坡地區報導。簡報以標題、表格與連結正確排版，中英文皆可讀；任何一期均可朗讀，自選聲音與語速，螢幕關閉仍可播放。最新期號與已收藏內容預先下載，離線照樣閱讀，並可搜尋數千篇舊簡報。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-128-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-129-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-130-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-274-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-132-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-133-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Deltabrief</li>\n<li>應用類別：News</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:20:19.019717+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:58:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:18:03.487506+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T14:17:44.488137+00:00","content_hash":"db12ce57305b4f12cdfa4d3973dc062c51be9a2b79dad9c0d052d17eb5edcfde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}